smg:MeterMultiplierKind <http://langdale.com.au/2005/UML#hasStereotype> <http://langdale.com.au/2005/UML#enumeration>;
                        a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                        rdfs:comment "Kind of meter multiplier.";
